00:02:58.630 --> 00:02:59.956
Leftovers.

64
00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:02.926
Now let's listen to a conversation.

65
00:03:03.226 --> 00:03:05.481
Sreypich, can you tell me how to make a cake?

66
00:03:06.783 --> 00:03:09.366
Sure! First, mix the ingredients.

67
00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:11.698
What do you do next?

68
00:03:12.983 --> 00:03:15.169
Then, put the mix in a pan and bake it.

69
00:03:16.483 --> 00:03:17.519
And finally?

70
00:03:18.817 --> 00:03:21.199
Finally, let it cool and serve it with fruit!

71
00:03:22.483 --> 00:03:24.680
Grammar focus: Sequencing words.

72
00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:27.981
First, mix the ingredients. Then, bake the cake.

73
00:03:28.281 --> 00:03:31.897
Sequencing words make instructions clear. Put a comma after them.

74
00:03:32.883 --> 00:03:35.640
Now read and listen. Baking with Mum.

75
00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:38.230
My mother follows a recipe to bake a cake.

76
00:03:39.517 --> 00:03:42.805
First, we chop and peel the fruit and get all the ingredients ready.

77
00:03:44.117 --> 00:03:47.231
Next, we mix the flour, eggs and sugar and stir well.

78
00:03:48.517 --> 00:03:51.143
Then, we bake the cake in the oven for forty minutes.

79
00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:56.261
Finally, we serve it to the family, and there are never any leftovers!

80
00:03:57.550 --> 00:04:00.075
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

81
00:04:00.375 --> 00:04:02.165
blank, mix the ingredients.

82
00:04:02.465 --> 00:04:06.003
A, First. B, Finally. C, Last.

83
00:04:10.017 --> 00:04:11.877
The answer is A: First.

84
00:04:13.383 --> 00:04:15.011
To cook in an oven is to blank.

85
00:04:15.311 --> 00:04:18.291
A, bake. B, boil. C, fry.

86
00:04:22.283 --> 00:04:23.935
The answer is A: bake.

87
00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:27.891
Food that is not eaten after a meal is blank.

88
00:04:28.191 --> 00:04:32.181
A, leftovers. B, ingredients. C, recipes.

89
00:04:36.183 --> 00:04:38.438
The answer is A: leftovers.

90
00:04:39.950 --> 00:04:43.868
Now it's your turn to speak. What is your favourite dish to cook or eat?

91
00:04:49.168 --> 00:04:57.154
My favourite dish is fried rice. First, I chop vegetables. Then, I fry them with rice and eggs. Finally, I serve it hot.

92
00:04:57.454 --> 00:04:59.199
Excellent answer, Sreypich!

93
00:05:00.183 --> 00:05:04.693
Great work today! You learned twelve new words and sequencing words.

94
00:05:04.993 --> 00:05:09.085
Today's value is patience. Wait calmly and take your time.

95
00:05:09.385 --> 00:05:11.701
See you in Unit three. Goodbye!

96
00:05:12.001 --> 00:05:14.897
Thank you, Mr. Jake! Bye, everyone!

